      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Items come in different shapes, sizes, prices, and rarities. Combine them into even stronger equipment. Brew a powerful potion, craft a legendary weapon, or hatch a dragon friend! There are over 500 different items to choose from!",
